SoundCorral application icon attribution
======================================

The bundled SoundCorral application icon is derived from the Breeze icon
theme (breeze-icons), provided by the KDE Community.

  Upstream: https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/breeze-icons
  Original files:
    devices/64/audio-card.svg
    devices/22/audio-card-symbolic.svg
  License: LGPL-3.0-or-later (and LGPL-2.1-only where applicable)

The icon files are redistributed unmodified, only renamed under the
SoundCorral application id so the app can use a consistent icon on every
desktop theme. The 128x128 PNG is rendered from the 64px SVG.

License texts are included alongside this notice:
  LICENSE-LGPL-3.0-or-later
  LICENSE-LGPL-2.1-only

The rest of SoundCorral remains under the MIT license (see the repository
README).
